      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Uploading last build is a pretty essential option to have. No idea why they decided to remove it. Why would we want to [Build and Test] to see the world functional, only then to [Build and Upload] again making the upload process twice as long for the build process? \n\nI have spotty internet and uploads tend to fail and that's when I can just retry uploading the last build at a later time. Now I would have to rebuild each time and hope that it doesn't fail.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
